  title: Wire transition
  text: One shader, no inputs. A wire draws across and swells into a dark band that covers the frame (cut underneath at Progress 0.47 to 0.53), then a clear band opens from the same wire.
  position: [55, -190]
  size: [745, 450]
  color: [0.13, 0.28, 0.32]
  opacity: 0.25
